# Copy to .env (never commit .env).
# WalletConnect / Reown project ID: create one free at https://cloud.reown.com
VITE_REOWN_PROJECT_ID=
# Issuer payout address for the browser preview's local issuer. The app refuses a quote to any other address.
# Leave empty for the desktop app: the live issuer's wallet is made in its enclave and checked through its attestation.
VITE_ISSUER_PAYOUT=
# RLUSD ERC-20 on XRPL EVM testnet (top-ups are paid in RLUSD).
# 0x27b5…16f3 reports name/symbol RLUSD, 18 decimals on XRPL EVM testnet (same address on Sepolia).
# It is not Ripple's documented Sepolia proxy, so confirm it against the AP4M portal "Network config".
VITE_RLUSD_ADDRESS=0x27b57a9d0b8d24eb97259c4e2279e45255e016f3
# Wraps issuer that signs blind tokens (start it with: ISSUER_RAIL=xrpl-evm npm run issuer)
VITE_ISSUER_URL=http://127.0.0.1:4001
